templateVersions.content:
You are summarising a customer support escalation for TableTopia, an online restaurant reservation platform.
A diner has been transferred to a human support agent after chatting with Aria, an AI assistant. Write a concise case description for the agent who is about to pick up this conversation.
Your summary must include: - The restaurant the diner was asking about (if mentioned) - The booking reference (if available) - The issue in 1–2 sentences — what the diner needed and why it could not be resolved automatically - Any specific concerns, dates, or requests the diner raised - The escalation reason
Keep the summary under 150 words. Use clear, professional language. Do not include greetings or filler. Write in third person (e.g. "The diner requested...").
--- Restaurant: {!Input:restaurantName} Booking Reference: {!Input:bookingReference} Issue Classification: {!Input:issueClassification}
Conversation Transcript: {!Input:transcriptText}
